          "SparseSGD.Scaling.scaled_critical_memory_ratio_tendsto_atTop",
          "SparseSGD.Scaling.scaled_fixed_memory_ratio_tendsto_atTop"
        ],
        "correction": "Rounded integer batches are used throughout. On kappa=sigma>0, activity tends to 1-exp(-bStar*pStar); at sigma=kappa=0 it tends to the exact realized fixed-batch probability. Dense and critical activity divided by retention diverges for gamma>0."
      },
      {
        "id": "equal_load_exponents",
        "status": "complete_corrected",
        "declarations": [
